### Admin KYC APIs

### 1. Get Pending KYCs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/kyc/pending?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. Get KYC Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/kyc/{{kycId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3. Approve KYC
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/kyc/{{kycId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. Reject KYC
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/kyc/{{kycId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  \"rejectedReason\": \"Ảnh giấy tờ bị mờ, vui lòng gửi lại\"
}

---

### Admin Rooming House APIs

### 5. Get Pending Rooming Houses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rooming-houses/pending?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. Get Rooming House Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rooming-houses/{{roomingHouseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. Approve Rooming House
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rooming-houses/{{roomingHouseId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Reject Rooming House
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rooming-houses/{{roomingHouseId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  \"rejectedReason\": \"Thông tin khu trọ không đầy đủ, vui lòng bổ sung\"
}

---

### Public Listing APIs (No Authentication Required)

### 9. Get Public Rooming Houses (List)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/rooming-houses?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&searchKeyword=&minPrice=&maxPrice=

### 10. Get Public Rooming House Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/rooming-houses/{{roomingHouseId}}

---

### Variables

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@adminToken = your_admin_jwt_token_here
@kycId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@roomingHouseId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
